    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 473,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 386,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65380,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 396,
        "headingId": 386,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These lesions are typically firm, indurated masses, sometimes with overlying ulceration.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:02"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 467,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 380,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65381,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 396,
        "headingId": 380,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The histology is variable and identical to that of sweat gland carcinomas at other cutaneous sites, as covered in the WHO classification of skin tumours [[Elder DE, Massi D, Scolyer RA, et al., editors. WHO classification of skin tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2018. (WHO classification of tumours series, 4th ed.; vol. 11). https://publications.iarc.fr/560.]] and published elsewhere {20606537; 22407069; 21651649; 27832810; 12581149; 24179652; 27668109; 19251959}. An origin from Bartholin gland should be excluded.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:02"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 468,
    "bookid": 34,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 381,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 65382,
        "bookId": 34,
        "chapterId": 396,
        "headingId": 381,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-06-09T16:32:02"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 469,
